{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"733827592045461538","content":"Sometime early in the morning a hooded figure can be seen carrying a body past town square and into the outskirts. The figure stops and magically excavates a small grave. The body is laid gently into the grave, and a short prayer is said. The figure covers the body by hand, then magically shapes the nearby clay into bricks and hardens them. They take the bricks and stack them in a small cairn above the body. Another small prayer is said, the figure bows to the cairn, and departs.","created_at":"2020-08-10T13:42:54.560000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"742377440663568434","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
